#. A note under the table of applications.
#: src/postulo_templates/templates/postulo_templates/handover/report.html
msgid "Applications drafted but never sent are not counted."
msgstr "Aplikimet e hartuara por të padërguara nuk numërohen."

#. Heading above the table of the job applications sent in the period, in a report laid out for France Travail. In French: « Candidatures ».
